    },
    {
      "id": "act02",
      "name": "第 2 幕",
      "scene": "war_council",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "今天把官渡之战摊在地图上，换个问法：如果曹操输了，历史会怎么走？",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act03",
      "name": "第 3 幕",
      "scene": "battlefield",
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "我输不起，因为我的粮道只有一条，烧了就什么都没了。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act04",
      "name": "第 4 幕",
      "scene": "palace_hall",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "可你赢了，也只是把乱世推迟了二十年。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b",
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act05",
      "name": "第 5 幕",
      "scene": "scholar_study",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "地图上这条线，就是两个人的生死线。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act06",
      "name": "第 6 幕",
      "scene": "war_council",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "先看这张地图，许攸投奔那晚，乌巢的粮仓就在这条河边。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act07",
      "name": "第 7 幕",
      "scene": "battlefield",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "所以我说，决定胜负的不是兵多，是我敢不敢烧掉自己的退路。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act08",
      "name": "第 8 幕",
      "scene": "palace_hall",
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "可火烧起来之后，北方的百姓还要过很多年苦日子。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b",
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act09",
      "name": "第 9 幕",
